1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:01,999
看这粒火星
Watch this spark.

2
00:00:01,999 --> 00:00:04,527
碰到油，整座洞穴就出事了
It touches oil, and the cave is in trouble.

3
00:00:05,157 --> 00:00:08,787
这团混乱，不是一段播好的动画
This chaos is not a prerecorded animation.

4
00:00:08,787 --> 00:00:12,631
沙、水、火，都在现场按规则变化
Sand, water and fire are changing under local rules.

5
00:00:12,911 --> 00:00:15,507
这一期，拆开《Noita》的像素魔法
This episode, we unpack the pixel magic of Noita.

6
00:00:16,557 --> 00:00:18,100
先把洞穴放大
First, zoom into the cave.

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,329
一个格子，存一种材料
Each cell stores a material.

8
00:00:20,609 --> 00:00:22,225
画面每前进一步
At each simulation step,

9
00:00:22,225 --> 00:00:25,781
材料就检查身边的格子，再决定移动或反应
materials inspect nearby cells, then move or react.

10
00:00:26,061 --> 00:00:27,699
这里是教学重演
This is an educational reconstruction,

11
00:00:27,699 --> 00:00:30,648
不是游戏源码，也不代表原版性能
not the game's source code or a measure of its performance.

12
00:00:31,798 --> 00:00:33,073
先只倒沙
Start with sand alone.

13
00:00:33,073 --> 00:00:35,260
下面空着，就往下掉
If the cell below is empty, fall into it.

14
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:38,583
正下方堵住，再试两条斜路
If blocked below, try the two diagonals.

15
00:00:38,583 --> 00:00:40,778
都走不通，就停下来
If neither works, stay put.

16
00:00:41,358 --> 00:00:43,266
没有人画沙堆的轮廓
Nobody draws the outline of the pile.

17
00:00:43,266 --> 00:00:46,445
一粒粒沙重复这条规则，坡就长出来了
Grains repeat the same rule, and a slope emerges.

18
00:00:48,095 --> 00:00:50,322
换成水，多给它一条路
Water gets another option:

19
00:00:50,322 --> 00:00:52,721
落不下去，还能往两边流
when it cannot fall, it can spread sideways.

20
00:00:53,251 --> 00:00:55,930
看它绕过石头，灌进低处
Watch it flow around rock and into low ground.

21
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:58,610
沙沉进水里，油浮在水上
Sand sinks through water; oil stays above it.

22
00:00:58,890 --> 00:01:01,246
材料不必认识整座洞穴
A material need not know the whole cave.

23
00:01:01,246 --> 00:01:04,327
眼前几个邻居，就能改变大场面
A few nearby cells can reshape the scene.

24
00:01:05,777 --> 00:01:07,876
现在，把火放进来
Now add fire.

25
00:01:07,876 --> 00:01:10,930
火碰到油和木头，会点燃邻居
Touching oil or wood can ignite a neighboring cell.

26
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:13,978
燃料被消耗，烟往上飘
Fuel is consumed and smoke rises.

27
00:01:13,978 --> 00:01:16,954
一处接触，变成一串连锁反应
One contact becomes a chain reaction.

28
00:01:17,234 --> 00:01:18,767
意外就藏在这里
This is where accidents begin:

29
00:01:18,767 --> 00:01:21,834
规则很短，碰在一起的结果却很难预料
short rules combine into outcomes that are hard to predict.

30
00:01:23,484 --> 00:01:26,217
可洞穴这么大，每次都扫一遍？
But must every step scan the entire cave?

31
00:01:26,217 --> 00:01:28,780
大部分石头，明明根本没动
Most of that rock has not moved at all.

32
00:01:29,410 --> 00:01:30,867
把世界切成块
Divide the world into chunks.

33
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:34,430
发生变化的区域亮起来，安静的区域先休息
Changing regions light up; quiet regions can sleep.

34
00:01:35,010 --> 00:01:37,682
移动和反应，会唤醒附近的块
Movement and reactions wake nearby chunks.

35
00:01:37,682 --> 00:01:41,356
右边显示的，是这次演示实际访问的格子数
The readout shows cells actually visited in this reconstruction.

36
00:01:43,206 --> 00:01:44,366
拉回洞穴
Pull back to the cave.

37
00:01:44,366 --> 00:01:47,846
现在你看到的，是无数条小规则正在相遇
You are watching countless small rules meet.

38
00:01:48,626 --> 00:01:49,886
而下一场事故
And the next accident

39
00:01:49,886 --> 00:01:51,427
也许只差一粒火星
may be just one spark away.
